<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_cache_manager">CacheManager</link></para>

<para>Manages disk-based caching of configuration files to improve warm startup performance. Reduces subsequent startup times by 92% for configuration parsing.</para>

<para>Portable: <link linkend="_class_cache">Cache</link> stored in app&apos;s tmp/ directory, travels with installation. </para>
<para>
Definition at line <link linkend="_class_8cachemanager_8php_source_1l00017">17</link> of file <link linkend="_class_8cachemanager_8php_source">class.cachemanager.php</link>.</para>
</section>
